+/*
+ * Huawei Ascend DVPP H.264/H.265 hardware decoder.
+ *
+ * Supports dual output modes:
+ *   1. Host Mode (AV_PIX_FMT_NV12, default):
+ *      Single 1D DMA into an AVBufferPool of aclrtMallocHost pinned buffers,
+ *      zero kernel dynamic page-pinning and zero CPU plane-copy.
+ *   2. Device-Resident Zero-Copy Mode (AV_PIX_FMT_ASCEND):
+ *      Enabled via `-hwaccel ascend -hwaccel_output_format ascend` or
+ *      `-device_output 1`. Wraps NPU DVPP device buffers directly in AVFrame
+ *      with zero D2H PCIe transfer for full-pipeline NPU transcoding/inference.
